<title>SOUTH KOREA: SAMSUNG HEAVY POSTS 91.2 BLN WON NET LOSS.</title>
<headline>SAMSUNG HEAVY POSTS 91.2 BLN WON NET LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net	 loss  91.2	vs   profit  7.4</p>
<p>    Turnover     1,756	  vs	 1,664.5</p>
<p>Note - Samsung Heavy Industries Co is the machinery and shipbuilding unit of the Samsung Group. A company official attributed the loss to large financing costs following heavy investment in dockyard expansion and in commercial vehicle production.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
